{"version":1,"content":"<p>關錦鵬、巫雨田（新劍郎）及徐克，今天（16日）出席《香港演藝學院榮譽博士暨榮譽院士頒授典禮》，林青霞到場賀徐克獲頒榮譽博士，獲頒榮譽院士關錦鵬於台上表現緊張，他受訪時表示真心受之有愧，「不是謙虛，我拍電影都是做自己鍾意做的事，而有機會可以做到。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:00:30.905139+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:05:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:36.169973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:58:03.817121+00:00","content_hash":"d11ea1db870fbd39650c0922f653864eb8ca67d589e725dd6f2863cb7ad49d3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}